      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In 1985 I had back surgery, and I began to keep a journal. I thought it would help me track my progress. I wrote in it often, sometimes two or three times a day. It became a lifeline for me. Four years and ten volumes later it tells my story, the story of my struggle with pain."},
